h='''<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><meta http-equiv="Content-Security-Policy" content="default-src 'none'; style-src 'unsafe-inline'; base-uri 'none'; form-action 'none'"><title>MESA: proposed accessibility guidance</title><style>:root{color-scheme:light dark}*{box-sizing:border-box}body{font:1.125rem/1.65 system-ui,sans-serif;max-width:76ch;margin:2rem auto;padding:0 1rem;overflow-wrap:anywhere}a{color:light-dark(#174f9b,#9ec8ff)}:focus-visible{outline:3px solid light-dark(#174f9b,#9ec8ff);outline-offset:4px}section{margin-block:2rem;border-top:1px solid #888;padding-top:1rem}summary{cursor:pointer;padding:.5rem 0}pre{white-space:pre-wrap;font:inherit}.note{border-inline-start:4px solid #888;padding-inline-start:1rem}h1,h2,h3{line-height:1.3}nav ul{padding-inline-start:1.25rem}@media(max-width:40rem){body{margin:1rem auto}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){*{scroll-behavior:auto}}</style></head><body><a href="#questions">Skip to questions</a><h1>MESA: proposed accessibility guidance</h1><p class="note">Proposed revision, version accessibility-v1. This reading-only prototype is separate from the live participant survey and from the original model study. It collects no answers and stores or sends nothing. Ease of use has not been evaluated with people.</p><p>MESA uses 25 questions, six groups and five answer choices. Comments remain optional, and answers are not added into a quality score.</p><nav aria-label="Contents"><ul><li><a href="#choices">Answer choices</a></li><li><a href="#questions">25 questions</a></li><li><a href="#comments">Optional comment prompts</a></li><li><a href="#reminders">Closing reminders</a></li><li><a href="#reading">Benchmark reading and completed example</a></li></ul></nav><section id="choices"><h2>Answer choices</h2><p>Yes: the information supports the whole condition. Partly: it supports some parts. No: the information shows that the condition is not met. Not sure: the information is missing or insufficient. Not applicable: the issue does not arise for this benchmark or use.</p></section><section id="questions"><h2>The 25 questions</h2>'''
